{"ticker":"ABEO","company":"ABEO","description":"Abeona Therapeutics Inc., a commercial-stage biopharmaceutical company, develops gene and cell therapies for life-threatening diseases in the United States. It develops ZEVASKYN, an autologous, cell-based gene therapy for the treatment of patients with recessive dystrophic epidermolysis bullosa. The company also develops ABO-503 to treat X-linked retinoschisis; ABO-504 for the treatment of stargardt disease; and ABO-505 to treat autosomal dominant optic atrophy. In addition, it is developing AAV-based gene therapy through its AIM vector platform programs.","prices":[["2024-05-29",4.06],["2024-05-30",4.21],["2024-05-31",4.38],["2024-06-03",4.52],["2024-06-04",4.33],["2024-06-05",4.52],["2024-06-06",4.28],["2024-06-07",4.27],["2024-06-10",4.46],["2024-06-11",4.45],["2024-06-12",4.5],["2024-06-13",4.59],["2024-06-14",4.57],["2024-06-17",4.51],["2024-06-18",4.54],["2024-06-20",4.52],["2024-06-21",4.58],["2024-06-24",4.35],["2024-06-25",4.22],["2024-06-26",4.09],["2024-06-27",4.19],["2024-06-28",4.24],["2024-07-01",4.2],["2024-07-02",4.12],["2024-07-03",4.35],["2024-07-05",4.54],["2024-07-08",4.8],["2024-07-09",5.0],["2024-07-10",4.99],["2024-07-11",5.19],["2024-07-12",5.51],["2024-07-15",5.39],["2024-07-16",5.34],["2024-07-17",5.42],["2024-07-18",5.04],["2024-07-19",5.11],["2024-07-22",5.0],["2024-07-23",5.13],["2024-07-24",5.05],["2024-07-25",5.03],["2024-07-26",5.1],["2024-07-29",4.98],["2024-07-30",4.72],["2024-07-31",4.9],["2024-08-01",4.81],["2024-08-02",4.7],["2024-08-05",4.6],["2024-08-06",4.68],["2024-08-07",4.42],["2024-08-08",4.47],["2024-08-09",4.42],["2024-08-12",4.95],["2024-08-13",4.98],["2024-08-14",4.95],["2024-08-15",5.0],["2024-08-16",5.0],["2024-08-19",5.23],["2024-08-20",5.13],["2024-08-21",5.24],["2024-08-22",5.12],["2024-08-23",5.52],["2024-08-26",5.74],["2024-08-27",5.6],["2024-08-28",5.54],["2024-08-29",5.56],["2024-08-30",5.7],["2024-09-03",5.46],["2024-09-04",5.57],["2024-09-05",5.63],["2024-09-0